        "label": "Dimensional Flow & the Type Wall",
        "body": "The lattice enforces **type separation** (date/number/complex/string never auto-cross without a Cast) but allows **dimensional flow**: a value widens freely scalar → list → matrix → **frame**. A–D show widening; E shows the wall.",
