        "body": "A **text** or **date** won't wire straight into a number socket. Drag one to the `× 10` input and the cable is **refused**. The top two rows cross explicitly with **Cast**. The ONE auto-bridge is **logical → number** (bottom): a comparison feeds a math node directly, coercing TRUE→1.",
